// frob:waive REF002 reason="T-3006 worked-example fixture pair: storage_fast.strata \
// is this file's own sibling and only other real consumer besides \
// tests/unit/test_lang_strata_entity_arch.py -- both exist solely to be parsed by \
// that one test file's TestEntityArchitectureFixtures class \
// (docs/strata/entity_architecture.md#migration mentions the pair by name but is \
